      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_70cbe7bb2c2b28076f79be44beb5958f21e21d8473964332b7b9aa026cf593ff"
      ],
      "text": "There is no permission-mode setting: shell commands and file writes run unprompted with the sandbox as the boundary, MCP tools still prompt, and a deny pattern re-prompts even for shell; ACL denies are hard blocks."
    },
