      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_3e3555fb19cad0f98a811c5acc2ba087609ef49b606359f9bda3736639715f05"
      ],
      "text": "Permission rules come from a personal permissions.toml and a workspace .forge/permissions.toml; the repo-committed file's allow entries are ignored while its deny entries are always honored, so a checked-out repo cannot widen its own blast radius."
    },
