      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_aa459bf382d0911670f357bb76d154c164602916bd6480398dd73621e8780109"
      ],
      "text": "Agent orchestration is enabled by default: the model can spawn child agents via spawn_agent, send_message, followup_task, wait_agent, list_agents, and interrupt_agent; children run in isolated worktrees, inherit parent model/governance/policy, and can be tool-narrowed with tool_allowlist."
    },
    {
