          "repository": "norvialabs/forge",
          "url": "https://github.com/NorviaLabs/forge/blob/8a1c5e85ec5cd0dce38ba64a205d212c822488d2/README.md#L404-L416"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_186e6c9714b04116fcd9b8f7967d6d1d1fba85609e13fa90aff526b254822d1b"
      ],
      "text": "The README documents a residual Linux sandbox gap: read-only mounts do not stop Unix socket connections, so sockets under /var or /opt remain reachable despite masking of /run, /tmp, and home trees; tracked in issue #392."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_d86aed90dcb22d75feb37762f854c5875bdb35d1aa2c0371bab5e645679b7263",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
