          "line_end": 420,
          "line_start": 418,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "norvialabs/forge",
          "url": "https://github.com/NorviaLabs/forge/blob/8a1c5e85ec5cd0dce38ba64a205d212c822488d2/README.md#L418-L420"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_251a731c0545d4617bb94ba8f9ff56b94446de8c58e7c4f55e4453e4b06b3754"
      ],
      "text": "If the OS cannot confine (e.g. bubblewrap missing or unsupported platform), Forge refuses to start, printing the reason on stderr; there is no setting that turns oversight off without an enforcement floor."
    },
