        "slc_b03be6c2da7eaf8e71c840c7242c5d5a2f3718219e53db97297165468e14efe6"
      ],
      "text": "Colours are semantic tokens defined per theme rather than fixed hex values, and the design system names ACCENT_STATUS_MIN_HUE_DISTANCE as its single hardest rule, asserted over built-in themes in tests."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_8f1cbf5530a23deda01537e2cedf676823793c19414529ea1dde1db0fdacd123",
