      ],
      "text": "Forge ships native provider routes for OpenAI, Anthropic, xAI Grok (OAuth), OpenAI Codex subscriptions, OpenCode Go, OpenCode Zen, and local Ollama, configured via API-key environment variables or /connect."
    },
